    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This excellent three bedroom detached bungalow is set on c.0.75 acres of mature gardens in a beautiful scenic location with panoramic views of the surrounding countryside. The property is situated c.3 km from the picturesque village of Carrig. The front and rear gardens are in lawn with an array of mature hedges and trees. There is a post and rail fence fronting the property with cut stone piers. \n\nThe property itself was extended in c. 2000 and offers plenty of light filled, bright comfortable accommodation for modern family living. \nThe accommodation extends to an Entrance Hall, Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, Inner Hallway, Three Bedrooms, One En-Suite and Family Bathroom. \n\nThere are useful concrete block built storage sheds to the rear. \n\nThe property is serviced by both mains water and private well and septic tank. \n\n uPVC double glazed windows. Oil fired central heating. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment.\n\nKitchen - 3.32m (10'11) x 3.75m (12'4)\nTiled Flooring. Quality Fitted Kitchen. Plumbed for w/m and d/w. Electric hob and extractor fan.\n\nDining Room - 3.33m (10'11) x 3.25m (10'8)\nSolid wood flooring\n\nLiving Room. - 4.6m (15'1) x 3.8m (12'6)\nSolid Wood Flooring. Solid fuel stove, insert, Cast iron fireplace with wood surround. Coving, centre piece.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.66m (8'9) x 3m (9'10)\nWood Flooring. Fitted Wardrobe.\n\nBathroom 1 Ensuite - 1.7m (5'7) x 1.6m (5'3)\nFully tiled. W.C. W.H.B. Electric Shower Unit.\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.95m (9'8) x 2.7m (8'10)\nWood Flooring. Coving.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.38m (11'1) x 2.93m (9'7)\nWood Flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.78m (9'1) x 2.53m (8'4)\nWood Flooring. Fitted wardrobes and Press space around bed.\n\nBathroom 2 - 2.78m (9'1) x 2.53m (8'4)\nFully tiled. Bath. W.C. W.H.B. with Vanity Unit. Pump Shower over bath. Storage Press.\n\nInside Hall. - 2.75m (9'0) x 1.86m (6'1)\nWood Flooring. Hot Press. Fitted for clothes dryer.\n\n\nwhat3words /// shook.starch.dissonance\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
